<title>UK: FHLB sets $200 mln three-year bond, 33 b.p. over.</title>
<headline>FHLB sets $200 mln three-year bond, 33 b.p. over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers First Tennessee, HSBC Markets and</p>
<p>Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN BOARD</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    07.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.15	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+33 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/FR/DE/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.MAY.00 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658  </p>
<p>NOTES  CALL AT PAR AFTER ONE YEAR AND COUPON DATES THEREAFTER -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
